  pyq:{freq:"1–2 questions most sessions, sometimes one from Ray and one from Wave optics.",historical:"Consistently #1 or top-3 across nearly all multi-year analyses.",pattern:"Lens/mirror formula with sign convention, combination of lenses, YDSE fringe width, diffraction/polarisation basics.",difficulty:"Moderate."},
