  mustKnow:["Mirror/lens formula 1/v-1/u=1/f (Cartesian sign convention) and lensmaker's equation.","YDSE: bright fringe at path difference nλ, dark at (n+½)λ; effect of a thin film/slab shifts the pattern.","Resolving power of microscope/telescope is officially deleted — focus revision on lens combinations and YDSE instead."],
