  mustKnow:["Standard sums: Σn, Σn², Σn³ formulas — used inside difference-method problems.","AGP sum technique: S - (common ratio)S, then sum the resulting GP.","AM-GM-HM equality condition (all terms equal) is the key to many minimum/maximum value questions."],
